{"overview":"Nanami was just a normal high school girl down on her luck until a stranger’s lips marked her as the new Land God and turned her world upside down. Now, she’s figuring out the duties of a deity with the help of Tomoe, a reformed fox demon who reluctantly becomes her familiar in a contract sealed with a kiss. The new responsibilities—and boys—are a lot to handle, like the crow demon masquerading as a gorgeous pop idol and the adorable snake spirit who’s chosen the newly minted god to be his bride. As the headstrong Tomoe tries to whip her into shape, Nanami finds that love just might have cute, pointed fox ears. With romance in the air, will the human deity be able to prove herself worthy of her new title?","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":7,"y":2013,"poster":"/zb1HIj34fjGNvWPyj0gECUcmeUG.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2012,"poster":"/qzofSfOnYmQFhVccJoMxSMiG2EC.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2015,"poster":"/ntoJF5ad7cxv7zIbe7y5GGMZaXl.jpg"}],"episodes":25,"crew":["大地丙太郎"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"堀江由衣","role":"Numa no Himemiko (voice)","photo":"/73yQlMWaiOMrhvPCNyOCbbCkILZ.jpg"},{"name":"三森すずこ","role":"Nanami Momozono (voice)","photo":"/zsUuNDI3rLh0ngDUUWcwfjQn9Od.jpg"},{"name":"浪川大輔","role":"Sukuna Ryuuou (voice)","photo":"/iw0X8oDutxaBAri3Ifga8nhdUJK.jpg"},{"name":"岸尾だいすけ","role":"Kurama (voice)","photo":"/cH2JIa3Uc2k95yIuB462GwocPuT.jpg"},{"name":"佐藤聡美","role":"Ami Nekota (voice)","photo":"/ke0ROEfZo7kbu7icfO6ClWEtXIW.jpg"},{"name":"山崎バニラ","role":"Narrator (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"小林ゆう","role":"Isohime (voice)","photo":"/p3OKrnliz2C8ub14Pn5pN3T8Q9B.jpg"},{"name":"森嶋秀太","role":"Isobe (voice)","photo":"/OT9dZqzdPz5EvYn9fsSyxKUVRO.jpg"},{"name":"石田彰","role":"Mikage (voice)","photo":"/jnW2Gn2NlR2uwOCeyOuzypnTmkH.jpg"},{"name":"آکمی اوکامورا","role":"Kamehime (voice)","photo":"/qEwVfsrA23SCzRZMSlghw2sHctQ.jpg"},{"name":"立花慎之介","role":"Tomoe